{"time": 1755526166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132265859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“放心吧，这不是管制铁制品。而且我也教过他不会对着人”，"}
{"time": 1755526180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173263210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“我这是什么运气...”*小声"}
{"time": 1755526182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506414925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“啊、可巧！这不是佩雷斯吗！你来为我祷告祝福了？！”"}
{"time": 1755526265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631293025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“我离开家乡多年、尼古拉斯和桑丘可还好？他们也来此处为我助威了吗？”"}
{"time": 1755526267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708003057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“这孩子有点缺陷”指指脑袋，“我们院在通过情景剧疗法帮他治疗，麻烦您了”*对神父耳语"}
{"time": 1755526299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394648249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1017246701", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“尤其是桑丘、分别多年，甚是怀念我们当初闯荡天下的有趣冒险时光啊……”"}
